// Stairs: tg's plain flight, one picture per way up. One family of
// `tfs/assets/sprites.ron`'s roster; baked in file-name order.
//
// tg draws `/obj/structure/stairs` from `stairs.dmi` "stairs" in its `dir`
// (code/game/objects/structures/stairs.dm:14-18). NOT PORTED: the merged
// "stairs-l"/"-m"/"-r" states a flight picks by its neighbors
// (stairs.dm:155-179), the wood, stone and material flights and the frames.
(
    sheets: [
        ("stairs", "obj/stairs.dmi"),
    ],
    groups: [
        (sheet: "stairs", sprites: [Directions("stairs", "stairs")]),
    ],
)
